.TH COF-TUI 1 "2026-11-13" "cof 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cof-tui \- Launch the terminal UI (requires the 'tui' extra)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
cof tui [OPTIONS]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches the terminal UI (requires the tui extra: pip install
\&'circuitry-cof[tui]').
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The command failed, or the input was invalid.
.TP
.B 2
A usage error -- an unrecognized option or missing argument.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBcof(1)\fR, \fBosi(1)\fR
